  "descriptionShort": "Share of the population aged 15–64 who used a [generative AI](#dod:generative-ai) website or app during the reported period. Estimated from anonymized usage data on Microsoft platforms, scaled up to represent each country's working-age population.",
  "descriptionProcessing": "The world aggregate is taken directly from Microsoft's Q1 2026 report (p. 5), where it is reported as a population-weighted global figure. It cannot be reproduced from a simple average of country-level values because some countries use regional imputation.",
